  "bio": "Renata Vignati is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Portland, United States, who specializes in crafting traditional tattoos infused with a touch of magic. They maintain a high level of professionalism, preferring to schedule bookings through their website and not through direct messages. Their trademark style of traditional tattoos has become well-known throughout both Portland and the Seattle-Whidbey Island area.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Portland, Oregon, United States\n\n✦ Traditional tattooing with a bit of Magic\n❉ Whidbey Island @blackrabbittattoolangley \n✦ Seattle @36thstreettattoo\n❉ Contact: renavignati@gmail.com",
